tment</p></td><td><p>Financial Advice &amp; Accounts</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>09/11/1998&nbsp;to 18/09/1999</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5.</p></td><td><p>ACFA (FYS) DCDA (FYS)</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>C OF F &amp; A, KIRKEE</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>Defence Accounts Department</p></td><td><p>Financial Advice &amp; Accounts</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>20/09/1999&nbsp;to 07/04/2003</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6.</p></td><td><p>DCDA</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>PCDA SC, PUNE</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>Defence Accounts Department</p></td><td><p>Financial Advice &amp; Accounts</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>07/04/2003&nbsp;to 04/06/2004</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7.</p></td><td><p>IFA</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>IFA 24 ED, ALLAHABAD</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>Defence Accounts Department</p></td><td><p>Financial Advice &amp; Accounts</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>06/06/2004&nbsp;to 26/06/2006</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>JCDA</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>JCDA (R&amp;D), PUNE</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>Defence Accounts Department</p></td><td><p>Financial Advice &amp; Accounts</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>27/06/2006&nbsp;to 30/04/2007</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9.</p></td><td><p>DY FINANCIAL ADVISER (ATV)/DIRECTOR</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>MINISTRY OF DEFENCE (FINANCE) (ON CENTRAL DEPUTATION), HYDERABAD</p></td><td colspan="2"></td><td></td><td colspan="2"><p>01/05/2007&nbsp;to 30/04/2012</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10.</p></td><td><p>ADDL. CDA</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>CDA(R&amp;D) HYDERABAD MO, HYDERABAD</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>Defence Accounts Department</p></td><td><p>Financial Advice &amp; Accounts</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>02/05/2012&nbsp;to 26/08/2012</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>11.</p></td><td><p>IFA</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>IFA (NAVY) WNC, MUMBAI</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>Defence Accounts Department</p></td><td><p>Financial Advice &amp; Accounts</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>27/08/2015&nbsp;to 27/03/2017</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>12.</p></td><td><p>CDA</p></td><td colspan="2"><p>C